{{see|takk fyri}}
==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From ''[[takk]]'' meaning "[[thanks]]" + ''[[fyrir]]'' meaning "[[for]]". Literally meaning "[[thanks]] [[for]]...".
===Interjection===
'''[[takk]] [[fyrir]]''' (+ {{accusative}})

# [[thank you]], [[thanks]] (''literally: thanks for [that]'')

